[al:新概念英语（二）]
[ar:MP3 同步字幕版（美音）]
[ti:Everything Except the Weather]
[by:更多学习内容，请到VeryCD.com搜索“露珠”]
[00:10.98]Why did Harrison sell his house so quickly? | 为什么哈里森很快就卖了房子？
[00:16.51]My old friend, Harrison, had lived in | 我的老朋友哈里森在回到英国以前，
[00:20.00]the Mediterranean for many years | 曾在地中海地区
[00:22.65]before he returned to England. | 生活过许多年。
[00:25.97]He had often dreamed of retiring in England | 他过去常常梦想退休后到英国去，
[00:29.89]and had planned to settle down in the country. | 并计划在乡间安顿下来。
[00:33.61]He had no sooner returned than he bought | 他刚一回到英国
[00:37.38]a house and went to live there. | 便买下了一幢房子住了进去。
[00:40.05]Almost immediately he began to complain | 但紧接着他就开始
[00:43.62]about the weather, | 抱怨起天气来，
[00:45.62]for even though it was still summer, | 因为尽管那时仍处于夏季，
[00:49.20]it rained continually and it was often bitterly cold. | 但雨总是下个不停，而且常常冷得厉害。
[00:54.84]After so many years of sunshine, | 在阳光下生活了那么多年之后，
[00:57.84]Harrison got a shock. | 哈里森感到吃惊。
[01:00.47]He acted as if he had never lived in England before. | 他的举动就好像他从未在英国生活过似的。
[01:05.60]In the end, it was more than he could bear. | 最后，他再也忍受不住了。
[01:09.79]He had hardly had time to settle down | 他还没来得及安顿下来，
[01:13.04]when he sold the house and left the country. | 就卖掉了房子，离开了这个国家。
[01:17.21]The dream he had had for so many years ended there. | 他多年的梦想从此就这样结束了。
[01:22.79]Harrison had thought of everything except the weather. | 哈里森把什么都考虑到了，唯独没考虑到天气。
